# Written by `uconsole usb-direct generate` (WP AUSB3): installation "cinema", unit sides (Sides).
# Run it on this unit only:
#   uconsole --device E6614C311B4A9C10 -f sides.dspi
# then save the unit's preset (Ctrl-S in the interface, or preset.save <slot>).
# Mode, D and the lock-error action are not here: the hub writes them (SETTINGS.md).
in.source usb
# output 0: SL (USB input 0)
mix 0 0 on 0
mix 1 0 off
mix 2 0 off
mix 3 0 off
mix 4 0 off
mix 5 0 off
mix 6 0 off
mix 7 0 off
# output 1: SR (USB input 1)
mix 0 1 off
mix 1 1 on 0
mix 2 1 off
mix 3 1 off
mix 4 1 off
mix 5 1 off
mix 6 1 off
mix 7 1 off
